[0m[0m[0m
[0m[0m
I removed the [38;5;10m* 8[0m to match the C behavior:[0m[0m
[1mrust
[0m[38;5;10mblake256_update(&mut s, &sk_prf[..SPX_N], SPX_N as u64);  // Correct - matches C
[0m[0m[0m
[0m[0m
